        "d1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Ingredients and doses",
            "answer": "<p>Nicotinamide riboside 300mg, quercetin 250mg, grapeseed extract 200mg, turmeric extract 200mg, pterostilbene 100mg, CoQ10 50mg and BioPerine 20mg.</p><p>Plus methylated folate 400µg, methylcobalamin B12 100µg, B1, B2, B3 and B6 at 100% RI, vitamin D3 1000IU, vitamin K2 as MK-7 75µg, zinc bisglycinate 15mg and copper 1mg.</p><p>No proprietary blends. Every dose is printed on the label.</p>"
          }
        },
        "d2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How to take it",
            "answer": "<p>Two capsules each morning, ideally with your first meal of the day. One pouch is 60 capsules - a 30-day supply.</p>"
          }
        },
        "d3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What to expect, and when",
            "answer": "<p>Weeks one and two are the quiet start - the work happens before your wearable has anything to show.</p><p>Most people notice sleep and afternoon energy first, then see recovery and HRV trends shift over the following weeks.</p>"
          }
        },
        "d4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What the research shows",
            "answer": "<p>A 51% increase in NAD+ over two weeks comes from published research on nicotinamide riboside - Conze, Brenner and Kruger, Scientific Reports 2019. That is an independent study, not a MUTO trial.</p><p>Figures of 94% for recovery and 92% for energy come from a self-reported survey of 87 MUTO customers aged 30–50, over 12 weeks.</p>"
          }
        },
        "d5": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Delivery, subscription and guarantee",
            "answer": "<p>Free next-day delivery across the UK. Pause, skip or cancel from your account at any time, with no phone call.</p><p>Try it for 90 days. If your numbers haven't moved and you don't feel the difference, tell us and we'll refund you in full.</p>"
          }
        }
